msgid "TOME@Crusader@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Crusader"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Vanquish all your foes by introducing the concept of the mission to your "
"people. Focus in adding new ways to use {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT."
"Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.SpiritDamageConcept.Name}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@AUTHOR@NAME"
msgstr "Yohan Aarnes Magnus, XIV Grandmaster of the Golden Order"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@AUTHOR@DESC"
msgstr ""
"\"Be without fear in the face of your enemies. Be brave and upright that the "
"holy may love thee. Speak the truth always, even if it leads to your death. "
"That is our mission.\""

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@Name"
msgstr "Armored Crusader"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT.Hyperlink} that expecializes in holding the "
"line with {GLOBAL.SpiritDamageConcept.Name}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@Unit@Skill"
msgstr "Crusader Assault"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@Unit@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Base 120% chance of target unit becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STUNNED."
"Hyperlink}. Enter {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink} after use."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Endue holy power unto a unit: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Add {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"SMITE_OF_GOD.Hyperlink} to all {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@Unit@Skill2"
msgstr "Furious Devotion"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill1@Unit"
msgstr "Armored Crusader"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill2@Name"
msgstr "Vanquisher Oath"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill2@SKILL@Name"
msgstr ""
"The fervor of our mission burns within: [bulletlist] [bullet/]This unit "
"gains +2 {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} to all attacks for 2 {GLOBAL."
"TurnConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Target a friendly unit: [bulletlist][bullet/]For 3 turns, gain +20% extra "
"damage towards {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DRAGON.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"UNDEAD.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FEY.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"FIEND.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MAGIC_ORIGIN.Hyperlink} units. "
"[bullet/]This effect then applies to adjacent friendly units and is repeated."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill3@Name"
msgstr ""
"+20% extra damage towards {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DRAGON.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.UNDEAD.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FEY.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.FIEND.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MAGIC_ORIGIN.Hyperlink} "
"units."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill3@Skill@Name"
msgstr ""
"Target friendly unit, for 2 turns: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Gain +4 {GLOBAL."
"SpiritDamageConcept.Hyperlink} to it's basic attacks. [bullet/]Basic attacks "
"are extended to 1-hex behind the target, dealing 30% of the original damage."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill3@Skill@DESC"
msgstr "Sword of Light"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill3@Desc"
msgstr "Spirit Blaze"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill2@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"To fulfill our sacred mission, we must all take upon the sword: [bulletlist] "
"[bullet/]Add {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MASTER_SUPPORT.Hyperlink} to all {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill4@Name"
msgstr "Enduring Fervor"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill4@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Even at the face of certain death, our mission all but empowers us: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]Damage penalties from {GLOBAL.CasualtyConcept."
"Hyperlink} are halved. [bullet/]Once this unit {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept."
"Hyperlink} reachs 40% or lower, gain +2 {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} "
"for 2 {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill5@Name"
msgstr "Sacred Mission"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill5@DESC"
msgstr "Shoot in a 2-hex line."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill6@Name"
msgstr "Warrior Priests"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill6@DESC"
msgstr ""
"This unit is trained to battle with sword and devotion, after using a "
"support ability: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Regain half your {GLOBAL."
"ActionPointConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Disable all {GLOBAL.SupportConcept."
"Hyperlink} abilities for 1 turn."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@Skill6@Group"
msgstr "Warrior Priest"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@DEBUFF@DESC"
msgstr "All support abilities are blocked due to Warrior Priest effect."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@DEBUFF@NAME"
msgstr "Warrior Priest"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@SPI@DESC"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+2 {GLOBAL.ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+2 "
"{GLOBAL.ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} per level of {GLOBAL.AlignmentConcept."
"Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} per Adjacent {GLOBAL."
"FarmConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ResearchPostConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[influence/] Holy Site"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@PANTHEON@NAME"
msgstr "Ascension: Defender of the Faith"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@PANTHEON@NAME2"
msgstr "Warrior Priest"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@PANTHEON@NAME3"
msgstr ""
"This unit is trained to battle with sword and devotion, after using a "
"support ability: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Regain half your {GLOBAL."
"ActionPointConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Disable all {GLOBAL.SupportConcept."
"Hyperlink} abilities for 1 turn. [bullet/]Additionaly, gain 20% increased "
"Healing Effectiveness for {GLOBAL.SupportConcept.Hyperlink} abilities at all "
"times."

msgid "TOME@Crusader@PANTHEON@NAME4"
msgstr "3"

msgid "TOME@Crusader@PANTHEON@NAME5"
msgstr "4"
